    note: `Our own work is quoted as fixed lines: a custom module or internal tool starts from ${P.software}, an integration or automation workflow from ${P.ai}, a customer-facing store that feeds the ERP from ${P.shop}, and upkeep from ${P.care} after two free months. Those are starting points for defined scope, in USD, quoted before anything is billed. Everything else on this page — Odoo subscriptions, SAP Business One licences, partner day rates, hosting, training rates — is an indicative range gathered to help you build a budget, and it is not a quote and not a fact. Vendor pricing changes by plan, term, region, reseller and negotiation, and the only number that counts is the one in a current written proposal addressed to your company. Use our ranges to sanity-check what you are told, then verify every line with the vendor or partner before it enters a board paper.`,
