        "Structured e-invoicing on a phased timetable: confirm current dates",
        "WPS salary file in the prescribed format for payroll",
        "Personal data handling under Federal Decree-Law No. 45 of 2021",
        "Mainland and free-zone entities, inter-company flows, consolidation",
        "Multi-currency with AED pegged at 3.6725 to the US dollar",
        "Bilingual document templates where customers expect Arabic",
